# Uploading a report

The portal hands out a signed link like this one:

<a href="https://acct.blob.example/reports/r.csv?sv=2020-10-02&amp;sig=@@S:md_sas_sig@@&amp;se=2030-01-01">download</a>

It expires after a day. After sign-in the browser lands on
`https://reports.example/#access_token=@@S:md_access_token@@&token_type=bearer`,
and the API takes `<a href="https://api.example/r?format=csv&amp;api_key=@@S:md_api_key@@">`.
It expires after a day.
